WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.030 --> 00:00:07.309
In today's healthcare environment
point-of-care begins with a touch.

00:00:07.309 --> 00:00:11.800
iHeart Touch for the iPad explains
coronary artery disease to patients

00:00:11.800 --> 00:00:15.100
using interactive simulations
and detailed medical animations.

00:00:15.300 --> 00:00:16.900
In the exam room or home,

00:00:16.900 --> 00:00:20.300
patients can take a self-guided tour
of coronary artery disease

00:00:20.300 --> 00:00:23.300
learning how it progresses 
silently over time.

00:00:23.300 --> 00:00:26.700
At each step, patients can watch accurate,
award-winning animations

00:00:26.700 --> 00:00:28.380
on treatment options

00:00:28.380 --> 00:00:31.589
and view richly illustrated articles

00:00:31.589 --> 00:00:34.700
all from Nucleus Medical Media.

00:00:34.700 --> 00:00:38.600
The iHeart Touch app is an excellent tool 
to use at the point-of-care

00:00:38.600 --> 00:00:43.500
or at home to raise health literacy and
improve patient satisfaction.

00:00:43.500 --> 00:00:49.500
Download iHeart touch today 
free in the App Store.

